{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the sounds of <strong>Harmony in the Wild</strong> through its original soundtrack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This cozy, string-driven score composed by Heikki Ketola is created to relax and calm players while supporting the emotional storytelling of the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Harmony in the Wild Soundtrack</strong> features both MP3 and high-quality WAV versions of the full 17-track score, that are composed exclusively for the game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb5 17 original, atmospheric tracks composed for Harmony in the Wild</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb6 Includes both MP3 and high-quality WAV versions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf3f A string-based, cozy and nature-inspired score</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd8a Themes accompany in-game locations, story moments, and quests</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you for your support and let the music of Harmony in the Wild bring you back to the heartfelt story anytime you wish!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3871000?t=1761325254","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3871000?t=1761325254","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871000/61e5b4d7a9f2fd646e9c8ee469b4b1303bd012b0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761325254","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871000/61e5b4d7a9f2fd646e9c8ee469b4b1303bd012b0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761325254","categories":[{"description":"Additional High-Quality Audio","id":50}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_parag